   "text": "WHEN THE BATTERY DIES, GO OUTSIDE.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 46
  },
  {
   "text": "Your whole job is weighing\ntrucks at night, and every\nwatt you use brings the\ndark closer.",
